# The ping bot: a DM that is just "ping" gets a reply naming the path.
# Carol is out of our range; Hilltop (a stock MeshCore repeater) relays.
repeater Hilltop 9 hunter2
node Carol 6
unlink Cardputer Carol
link Carol Hilltop 5
as Hilltop advert
as Carol advert flood
wait 6000
expect contacts 2
# Flood our advert so Carol learns about us through the repeater.
key menu
key down 4
key enter
wait 6000
hold esc 900
pref pingbot on
# Carol has no route to us yet: her ping floods, and the path comes with it.
as Carol dm Card ping
wait 8000
expect dms Carol 1
expect got Carol pong: 1 hop Hilltop, SNR
# Asked again at once: no second answer for a while.
as Carol dm Card Ping!
wait 8000
expect dms Carol 1
# Later, by the route Carol has learnt: our stored route, reversed.
wait 5000
as Carol dm Card test
wait 8000
expect dms Carol 2
expect got Carol pong: 1 hop Hilltop (stored route)
# Not a ping, or the bot off: no answer.
as Carol dm Card ping me
wait 12000
pref pingbot off
as Carol dm Card ping
wait 8000
expect dms Carol 2
key right
key enter
shot ping-bot-chat
